{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_8_level_st_08-01","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"st_08-01","title":"今日，血色滿溢","storyCode":"M8-1","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_08-01.txt","sourceHash":"20b71900b1f0a26f03001f1a642ec37faf72c8c5c984747a93f82cdefb8ae573","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_0"},{"type":"narration","text":"法律，原始的法律，同態復仇的背後是同樣原始的需要，對暴力的需要。\n城邦向居民許諾，用優厚的生活與穩定的環境安撫他們——\n讓他們的生命服務於一個人造的目標，馴化他們天性中的征服意志，教他們安心，令他們軟弱。\n我們的陛下是睿智的。\n諸多城邦將有力視作罪惡，將匱乏勇氣當作美德，將畏懼死亡看作進步。陛下將撕去他們的遮羞布，讓他們思考，讓他們反省。\n我們人類的血脈裡，一直流淌著一種渴望，一種對以行為宣洩自身生命力量的渴望。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_9"},{"type":"narration","text":"公平不是天生的。公平是依賴有智慧、有意志的力量去締造的。\n陛下將把他們需要的這一切，被城市帶走的這一切，還給他們。\n新的目標將被宣佈，陛下會重整他們被日常生活與無聊磨平的思維，喚醒他們身體裡被僵化的倫理束縛多時的血性。\n暴力貫穿我們的軀體，如果我們不讓它在我們的身心中自然發芽，我們將變得怨毒、渺小而麻木，也將因此招致自我的毀滅。\n常時畏懼的人是可鄙的。\n一個人想要活著，就應當被浸沒在暴力之中，認清眾多道德的虛偽，知曉現下大地的貧瘠。\n只有暴力才是真實的，能被感觸的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_6"},{"type":"narration","text":"不是懲罰，不是統治，不是價值的衡量與懷柔的偽飾，我們用拳頭和武器告訴他們我們活著，且應當活著。只有活著的人才該活著。\n我不責怪皇帝陛下對我判下的處罰，我不識時務地侮蔑了他向民眾傾訴的仁慈話語，因他捨不得他的子民輕易遭受劇烈轉變的痛楚。\n就算這樣，我對真理的坦述也不得停止。我必須不斷地、不斷地讚美陛下的真知灼見，我只能呼喚我的誠實，我不能沉默。\n事實上，我們不想要所謂正義，也不企盼安寧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_perimeter"},{"type":"narration","text":"目光短淺、奔走於自身利益的人才會沉湎於安寧。\n我們想要的，是動用我們血管裡奔湧的暴力，我們這自文明起源處就被啟發了的天性，我們奮勇掙扎和勝利的源泉。我們要使用暴力。\n一切修飾都只是正當化我們的需求，但這無關緊要。\n當我們需要，我們就當直接索求，把修飾留給歷史學家和道德衛士吧，他們才需要正當性，我們的生存可比任何理論都更正當。\n我們要傷害人，戰勝人，毀滅人，如果這對烏薩斯是場災難，那我們就應該把災難帶給他人，帶給烏薩斯之外的人。\n如果他們不強健，他們就該被消滅，有的人比其他人更適合生存，也更適合成就。\n軟弱就是邪惡。強大就是崇高。我們的法律理當建立在健全市民的身心需求之上，我們的國家不該服務於蛆蟲，也不該餵養更多病患。\n願我所鄙夷的這些狹隘的、貪圖安逸的臣民在審判後永居血湖，願陛下帶領烏薩斯走向永遠的繁榮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"——異端的君主傳道士在被烏薩斯皇帝判處絞刑後，走上絞架前的最後一次佈道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_chercen_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"切爾諾伯格核心城，中央區"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"間諜！烏薩斯的間諜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"他們在這！去和大夥說，他們在這！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"殺了他們，殺了他們！把他們掛在對接層上，把他們碾在龍門的樓上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香小隊成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"後撤吧，迷迭香。他們佔據了整座商廈，這個街區已經被他們封鎖了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香小隊成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我來吧。繞遠路的話，我們會被其它地方的整合運動攻擊的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你，看著點，那個術師......看著點！別讓她動手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"把她們弄死！快點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"好！好！！殺呀，殺了他們！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"（哥倫比亞語）要殺我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"叫你們不知好歹，叫你們脖子上拴的是烏薩斯的鏈子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香小隊成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香，不值得！他們已經差不多瘋了！我們換個街區，找找另外的突破口！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"拿弩槍來！拿弩槍來......把她的頭，把她的頭給打爆！剛才來這裡的那隻兔子也是......你也是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭沒從這裡走，是因為她不想像我這麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你們用什麼眼神看我？你是感染者，你是感染者，你們怎麼用那種眼神看我？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"合作？生還？什麼東西，哈哈，說什麼，烏薩斯都戰勝不了我們，我們贏了，贏了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"射擊！打她呀，打她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"沒用的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"沒用的。我不想你傷到我，你就什麼都做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事......怎麼回事！繼續打！繼續打！全部轟上去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"那是牆嗎？什麼法術......什麼東西！弩箭撞上去都爛了，都爛了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"別打那幾個牆壁似的東西，沒有用！那個看著就很堅固！叫術師們來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你懂什麼，我們就是對著她的臉打的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"但是箭射到她身上，碎片彈打到她臉上之前，就都撞上了什麼東西，透明的牆還是什麼，什麼東西！碎了，進不去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"垃圾術師，看你撐到什麼時候......你還有多少體力？！你撐不了多久，看你撐到什麼時候！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼，為什麼......你們難道射不穿嗎，她什麼也沒做啊，你們的弩炮呢，你們的賦能弩箭呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"轟炸啊，把她炸開花，炸得粉碎，炸得和該死的烏薩斯人一樣，然後做成晚上的湯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香小隊成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是迷迭香小隊，阿米婭！接通你了......勸勸她，你勸勸她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香小隊成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香，聽通訊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"穿制服的，啊哈，穿制服的，我們把你們吊死，風乾在電線上，讓腐毛嘴把你們啄個稀爛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"讓你們知道，知道看不起我們的下場！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"看不起我們的，害我們的，以前給我們使臉色的，哈哈，呵，全都殺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"全都丟進引擎裡，突突突突突突，肉沫噴出來，哈哈哈哈哈......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你在幹什麼？你怎麼在這手舞足蹈？！不要暴露小隊位置！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"廢話這麼多......魔族玩意！硬角的畜生！你憑什麼命令我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你當你是塔露拉，還是那個好死不死的老畜生？完了，他已經完蛋了！砰！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你們都得完蛋！我們烏薩斯人感染者......殺！殺了你們所有人！你們都是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"薩卡茲將感染者踢下了窗口。\n感染者嚎叫著，或者說，笑著，從七樓摔落在地，緊接著被弩炮炸成了碎片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"啐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"動手。把重火力武器拿出來。宰了他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，聽得見嗎？就從說好的路線走。通話完畢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香小隊成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_chercen_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"遊擊隊現在的動向呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"偵查幹員彙報說，已經集合的遊擊隊正在中央大道上正面攻擊其他整合運動守軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"還有一些遊擊隊的小隊，不進反退，他們四散向城市的各個部分......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......是這樣的，遊擊隊還有其他的職責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們這兩支小隊已經無暇顧及核心城內其他部分的狀況了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"突破封鎖需要的時間越長，我們剩下的時間就越少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果其他反遊擊隊派的感染者被遊擊隊牽制住了，我們就能更快到達指揮塔。不能浪費這個機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"對整個局勢的控制，依賴Raidian和Mantra的判斷。對戰場的控制......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......我和迷迭香都需要更多思考的空間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，迷迭香......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"在我們排除了伏擊干擾後，其他的迂回路線也得到了保證。但迷迭香，我想，迷迭香大概只會選擇破除眼前的阻礙吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"她大概已經這麼做了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......哎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生說中了。真是一塌糊塗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動已經崩潰了，他們的自相殘殺比對遊擊隊的攻擊來得還快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"平常他們自己的摩擦肯定也很多，現在愛國者死了，這個消息一下子被點爆了，然後什麼都亂掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"看看一路上那種慘狀，我不信他們能有多團結。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"通知其他小隊成員，集合。讓術師們收回無人機。我們去和迷迭香會合。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_chercen_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡已經處理好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香小隊成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香小隊成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，阿米婭。我們該有更好的處理方式的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"是我要這麼做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"交涉失敗不是問題，他們那個樣子，是沒法交流的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"可是他們在做壞事，放任他們，只會發生更多壞事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"整棟樓都......整棟樓你都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我做得太過火了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，沒有。不，只是我沒和你一起出過任務。親眼看見，很震撼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是羅德島的底牌，最強的戰爭機器......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿米婭，我說錯話了？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"narration","text":"核心城行動隊離艦前夕"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會允許。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生。這一次，我肯定要這麼做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"這個問題我們探討過很多次了，阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你的源石技藝耗費的是你的體力，甚至是你新陳代謝所需的生理活性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你的生命在......流逝。你不是一台機器，一門艦炮，你不能更換零件，也不能被繼續加工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不。也許你還不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......又一個太過漫長的記憶。我不確定那會給你的身體帶來多大的壓力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"每一次模擬的結果都很不理想，我還會排除這個選項。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那這樣，凱爾希醫生，我這麼說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這一次我必須這麼做。我要再解開一枚戒指。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，我們在探討一種暴力。這是你對我這麼說的。如果你不希望我現在阻止你，當時的你也不會讓我立誓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"議長與我一同鑄造這些戒指，為的就是不讓後來者輕易地走上這條道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我是在使用它，凱爾希醫生。我不會為武器辯護，也絕不會說哪一種能更快殺人的武器是好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，特蕾西婭小姐留給我的東西，絕對不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"從最開始起，它也許就不是被當做一種武器設計出來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"它不該被用來殺死誰......從來都不是。在使用它時，我在想的是我應該救下誰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我這幾年和它共處得出的結論。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......信任一種武器絕非明智之舉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你要把它當做手術工具而不是兇器去使用，你就得掌控它的刀刃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"刀刃對敵我而言都是刀刃，無論你怎麼運用，它的性質依然不會改變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭......它會割傷你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生，我不怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"傷口是會癒合的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"可是那會留下疤痕。令人不忍直視的疤痕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但我......我不會放棄的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"源石已經讓我的身體變成那樣了。再多傷口......也只是一兩個傷口而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是一件武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"需要我再舉一次那個傷人的例子嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——什麼例子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"誰來證明你我不是一種武器？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是否是一種武器，這要誰來定義？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"武器會思考嗎，會思考的武器會更可怕嗎，擁有自我意識就不再是一種武器了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不，阿米婭。我不同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我知道——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你已經長大了。\n我阻止不了你。\n決定是你自己來做。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_chercen_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，幹員，你說錯話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你見過，嗯......那麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......可愛的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"兵器......嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。不，我也不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭......更可愛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"對，對不起！我想不出......想不出其他該怎麼說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是人。是有喜怒哀樂的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"在這之後，找個機會向她道歉吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，沒有，阿米婭。沒事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，我們一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，等等，迷迭香......我會摔倒的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我要抓緊點。不能讓你被那些傢伙，那些感染者，不能讓他們傷到你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"慢點走......我們慢點走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"（也許我不該那麼說的。但......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherunder_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"中央區"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你看見了嗎，凱爾希？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_24"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧群化薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃，呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧群化薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別，別靠近。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"看見了。任何一個視力還正常的人都不能無視這種現象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——你還記得你在龍門遭遇的特殊感染者嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"那一個會促使其他感染者的器官發生變異的整合運動少年感染者。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"誰？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我記得。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧群化薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_091","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特的牧群嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼魔族也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧群化薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_091","isRemote":false,"text":"不要，不要向前，再往裡走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你幹什麼......我們要在前面佈防的！叛徒快打到這裡來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特這個傢伙，又在想什麼？我們繞過去，他們不會攻擊我們的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧群化薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_091","isRemote":false,"text":"只會，痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，等一下！你們幹什麼！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧群化薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_091","isRemote":false,"text":"痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動感染者","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"鬆手！！鬆手！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"各小隊成員，我們轉移。保持隱蔽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來我們要更換入口。有些不好的事情已經發生了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合運動感染者"]}]}
